Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,{Lalalalaing}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.80,0:00:06.75,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.75,0:00:07.52,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.52,0:00:08.09,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:09.11,PriPara,Rand2,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:09.67,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.67,0:00:10.39,PriPara,Rand3,0,0,0,,A monkey?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.39,0:00:11.30,PriPara,Randgramps1,0,0,0,,Or a giant flying squirrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:11.92,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:13.09,PriPara,Rand4,0,0,0,,No, it's just a cute girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:14.63,PriPara,Rand5,0,0,0,,Just what you were hoping for...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:15.67,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.67,0:00:16.14,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.14,0:00:17.02,PriPara,Rand1243,0,0,0,,It's actually a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:17.76,PriPara,Rand234,0,0,0,,A child.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.76,0:00:18.56,PriPara,Rand2,0,0,0,,Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:19.47,PriPara,Randgramps1,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:20.30,PriPara,Rand4,0,0,0,,That's too high!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.30,0:00:21.56,PriPara,Rand5,0,0,0,,Come down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.56,0:00:22.82,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.71,0:00:29.48,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Hey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.79,0:00:31.54,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I've lost something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.54,0:00:33.44,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,And I can't seem to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:35.15,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,It's dangerous up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:37.20,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It feels great up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:38.86,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Why don't you come up here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.27,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.58,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,C-Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.99,0:00:44.49,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:45.68,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Look that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.68,0:00:46.45,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.45,0:00:47.16,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.16,0:00:47.92,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:48.90,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:54.22,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,You won this time, Lina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Tel,0,0,0,,{[TEL]}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:00:58.66,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Th-That sound...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:00.39,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Glo!{part of her name... really...}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.97,0:01:06.30,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,It's a call from him!{do I want to do desuwa..?}{方 refers to people, not objects}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:10.19,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,H-Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:13.19,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Ms. Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.53,0:01:16.40,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,I-It has been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.15,0:01:19.95,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,We've found the ideal princess candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:22.47,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Huh? The ideal princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:24.91,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,W-What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.91,0:01:26.97,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,The one who shall claim victory in the Grand Prix,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.97,0:01:29.79,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,and ride atop the lead float in the Dream Parade...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.79,0:01:32.13,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,...is PriPara's ideal princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.73,0:01:35.84,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I believe she should be arriving there shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:39.05,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'll be leaving her in your care.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.47,0:01:43.99,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Why did you come to Parajuku?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.99,0:01:46.22,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,My prince asked me to{orig: asked me to}.{I was given an invitation by the prince.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.22,0:01:48.93,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Y-Your prince?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.31,0:01:52.01,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes, he's a truly wonderful person.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:54.92,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I can't see forests or lakes here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.92,0:01:57.70,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,but I've always dreamed of living{orig: wanted} a city life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:01:58.90,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm going to enjoy it to the fullest!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:00.45,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,I-I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.45,0:02:06.08,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,3775)}Yahoo!{echo!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.25,0:03:39.70,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Fuwari, the girl from the Palps!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:49.13,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,A princess candidate is coming here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.48,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}What should I do? What should I do?{どうしましょったらどうしましょ the lit is more like If she does what should I do}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:52.59,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}What should I do? What should I do?{どうしましょったらどうしましょ the lit is more like If she does what should I do}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.59,0:03:54.56,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Anyway, I should head out to greet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.93,0:03:56.40,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.40,0:03:58.49,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Yes, good aftern{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.27,0:04:00.48,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.48,0:04:01.73,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.73,0:04:03.75,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,What's with the goat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:05.97,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,We became friends on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.97,0:04:07.88,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Take off your hat when you're inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:10.16,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ah, pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.16,0:04:12.87,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Seriously, why a goat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.08,0:04:17.29,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This is an introduction letter from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:20.75,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,You're the ideal princess candidate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:22.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.10,0:04:24.39,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm Midorikaze Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.39,0:04:25.97,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.97,0:04:27.29,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.29,0:04:28.93,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.93,0:04:34.89,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,...PriPara's ideal princess that shall get to ride atop the lead float in the Dream Parade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{# Why is the goat with her?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Goat,0,0,0,,{Goat sounds}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.89,0:04:42.77,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's... She's this girl that smells like goat mixed with grass, acorns, mushrooms, and deer droppings?!{it's like how could the ideal princess candidate be this girl that... blah}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:45.08,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\i1}I do remember him saying something about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.08,0:04:48.36,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure there must be a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:50.11,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.11,0:04:53.50,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,This mountain smell that clings to you, I, Ookanda Gloria, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.50,0:04:54.47,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,...Lina-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.47,0:04:58.33,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,...will cleanse you of it.{ordering fucks this line}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.84,0:05:06.33,PriPara,Rina,0,0,0,,Here at Paprika Academy, you shall receive training that will take you from zero to being the ideal princess.{Here at Paprika Academy you shall receive training from zero to become the ideal princess.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:08.48,PriPara_2,Rina,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:08.48,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:09.79,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.45,0:05:10.26,PriPara_2,Principal,0,0,0,,Spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.80,0:05:13.51,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Big news!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:18.28,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,The PriPara princess scholarship student is transferring in today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:19.98,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Princess scholarship student?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:22.87,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's the talk of the school!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.87,0:05:24.75,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,I wonder what she's like.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:26.40,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:28.57,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Her name's Midorikaze Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:32.04,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,She's from the Palps; a mountainous area in EuroPara. {Do they seriously not know what the Alps are?? What are they learning in this school?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.95,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Of course you'd know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:36.07,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,She's a second year in middle school,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:40.16,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,but she's given special permission to live{orig: supposed to be living} in the Paprika Academy High School dorms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:42.23,PriPara,Others,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.23,0:05:43.56,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Unprecedented!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:45.17,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Wait, we have a high school?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.17,0:05:47.02,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,And dorms?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.65,0:05:49.09,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We do.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.44,0:05:51.49,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They've been around for quite some time.{We've had one for a long time.}
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.49,0:05:52.96,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,They're behind the gymnasium.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.96,0:05:55.05,PriPara,Lerla,0,0,0,,Eh? That's news to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.43,0:05:57.26,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,How careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.26,0:06:00.27,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,I couldn't read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.61,0:06:03.85,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,But living in the dorms sounds fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.85,0:06:06.55,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I should mention: Ms. Ookanda is the headmistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.55,0:06:08.03,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,On second thought, never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:11.08,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Princess scholarship student, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.08,0:06:17.10,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,She'll be the center of attention in the\Nupcoming Summer Dream Idol Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.10,0:06:20.25,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Will she be a rival? Or a partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:24.96,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,We don't know yet, but let us {orig: Since we don't know, we better }{put all our }focus on PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.96,0:06:26.21,PriPara,Lethy,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:28.43,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Same goes for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.43,0:06:31.04,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's search for our next teammates!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.04,0:06:33.67,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,...is what I'd like to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:36.48,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,but I also have work I need to do\N as the student council president.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:39.81,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I have to go meet the princess scholarship student now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.81,0:06:41.23,PriPara,Laphy,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:46.51,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Wow, we really do have a high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:48.42,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You don't have to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:49.88,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,But I wanna meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.88,0:06:52.15,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,It would be rude if I didn't meet her fully dressed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.65,0:06:56.45,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Since she's the princess scholarship student, \NI bet she'll look kinda like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:57.87,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,She's so sparkly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:01.79,PriPara_2,Principal,0,0,0,,Midorikaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.04,0:07:06.96,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Why are you sleeping there?{in a spot like that?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.56,0:07:13.42,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Good morning, Ms. Gloria.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:17.04,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,That bed is far too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:20.54,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,In the Palps, we'd always sleep on straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:21.67,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,You mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:23.89,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,You need to behave{orig: act} like a princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.89,0:07:27.10,PriPara_2,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's hard to move around in those pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.10,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Ah! It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.10,0:07:29.50,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, you're from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:31.61,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh? You know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.61,0:07:33.07,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Yeah, sort of.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:36.83,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,It's nice to properly meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.83,0:07:38.45,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,I'm Manaka Laala.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.45,0:07:42.04,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm the Student Council President \Nand Head Disciplinarian, Minami Mirei.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:44.66,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm Houjou Sophie.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.66,0:07:47.00,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,I'm a reincarnation of a jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:48.58,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.58,0:07:52.13,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'm aiming to be PriPara's ideal princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:07:55.51,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,How much longer do you plan on being in your pajamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.51,0:07:57.41,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Hurry up and change into your school uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.41,0:07:58.93,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll be fine in this instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:04.35,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This is easier to move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:06.31,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Ah! H-H-H-Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:19.68,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ms. Gloria, may I take this off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.68,0:08:24.55,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,In the Palps, it was only the cows \Nand goats who wore collars.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.55,0:08:26.08,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,That's a neck tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:28.32,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Please! It's suffocating!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.32,0:08:28.94,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,My turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.94,0:08:29.89,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.89,0:08:32.96,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Paprika Academy rule number 754:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:35.75,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"Students must address their teachers with respect"!{lit with an honorific}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.75,0:08:38.93,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to do this right after you've changed schools,\nbut I'm issuing your first insubordination ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:42.95,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Now that I get a better look at you,\Nyou look just like one of my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.95,0:08:44.52,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Eh? Friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:50.95,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Just like Komugi's tail and her cute behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:52.73,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{Sound of shock}Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:54.68,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Rule number 43:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.68,0:08:58.50,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,"Don't say that someone looks like a horse's butt"!{is someone keeping track of these? If not, someone should.}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Goat,0,0,0,,{Meh?}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.66,0:09:02.87,PriPara,Milapal,0,0,0,,Waa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:05.32,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,All right, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Goat,0,0,0,,{moar goat}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.12,0:09:07.83,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.83,0:09:09.80,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,School's going to be fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari+goat,0,0,0,,{goat noises}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.04,0:09:14.64,PriPara_2,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:14.32,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Fuwari seems like a really fun person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:18.01,PriPara_2,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Fuwari, get back here and accept your second ticket!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:18.01,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Yeah, a goat's friend is a friend of mine.{ my friend as well.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:21.81,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,I can understand her earlier feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{I can't fuckin make out anything other than like that's against the rules}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.81,0:09:24.56,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,But with my unrelenting guidance,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.99,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,she'll surely become the ideal princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.99,0:09:29.34,PriPara,Principal,0,0,0,,Right, Rina-chwan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.07,0:09:34.65,PriPara,Teach,0,0,0,,Let's see, Midorikaze will sit...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:38.61,PriPara,Teach,0,0,0,,Ah, there's no one sitting next to Dorothy West.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.76,0:09:41.95,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}So this is the princess candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.69,0:09:48.08,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh well, if I get along with her,\Nmaybe she'll join our five-person team.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.08,0:09:49.15,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.15,0:09:50.08,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:53.43,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,If you're a princess, then I'm a queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.43,0:09:55.01,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,so you can call me Your Highness.{Jyou}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:58.02,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's got a tablet?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.02,0:10:01.01,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}How cheeky for a middle school student!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.93,0:10:02.86,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:06.08,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Wait. Is that a mini chalkboard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.08,0:10:09.06,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's because the goat will eat my paper...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.06,0:10:10.38,PriPara,Goat,0,0,0,,Baa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:11.52,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Baa"?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:14.36,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That's my notebook!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:16.83,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,She said it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:18.94,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.94,0:10:21.14,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,She's the super worst!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.14,0:10:24.41,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's only been one day, but it's already been max craziness!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.74,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Don't eat my test too!{orig: It even ate my test!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.74,0:10:28.91,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,She said it's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.56,0:10:32.62,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What are you fishing in the pool for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.62,0:10:33.87,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I caught it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:36.09,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,And when I wanted to eat my lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.09,0:10:37.70,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What the heck are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,{# Isn't it obvious that she's milking her goat?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:39.06,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Milking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.01,0:10:43.68,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Happy birthday, baby birdy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:46.22,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Don't go and hatch birds on my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.22,0:10:49.43,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It was infuriating! {so frustrating!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.43,0:10:51.70,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Just what about her is princess-like?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.70,0:10:53.42,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Calm down, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.42,0:10:54.94,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Relax. Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:58.24,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Well, I can sympathize with Dorothy's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.24,0:11:00.75,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,With one wrong step, freedom becomes selfishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.75,0:11:02.05,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,Just like {\i1}Go!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.90,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,More like ego!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:08.10,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,She thinks she can get away with anything \Njust because she might win!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:08.87,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:13.74,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,With the way things are going, I wonder if\NFuwari will get used to school and PriPara...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.74,0:11:15.33,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,You're worried, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.75,0:11:19.71,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,I was just talking about  you, Fuwari!{could use Speak of the devil, but I think I used that with someone talking about Aloma and I don't want to repeat that to a "non-demon"}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.71,0:11:20.75,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.75,0:11:21.96,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, Laala!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.96,0:11:24.01,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,What are you looking for this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.38,0:11:25.91,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:28.22,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I made a promise with my prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.99,0:11:36.19,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}PriPara is a wonderful place overflowing with dreams, aspirations, and other beautiful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:41.65,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you become the ideal princess in PriPara for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.65,0:11:43.19,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.19,0:11:45.59,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, I'd be glad to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.64,0:11:50.21,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of place PriPara is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.21,0:11:51.81,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I can't wait to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:53.36,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Then let's go together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.03,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.71,0:11:59.22,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Hello, Meganee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:01.81,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Ah, you have a new face with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.81,0:12:03.42,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Did you bring your PriTicket with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.42,0:12:05.38,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.84,0:12:07.89,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,My prince told me about it.{this is the prince's ticket... who is probalby actually a girl... I'm calling it now.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.33,0:12:10.75,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Then let's pick out your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:12.54,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What's a coord?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.54,0:12:15.15,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,She's searching for the brand that best fits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.15,0:12:17.60,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of coord would look best on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.96,0:12:21.50,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The perfect brand for you is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:26.78,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Th-There isn't one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.78,0:12:27.23,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.23,0:12:28.07,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.07,0:12:28.69,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:31.49,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.77,0:12:43.17,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,What do you mean there isn't a brand?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.87,0:12:47.39,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,For some reason I can't find a coord that would fit her perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.39,0:12:50.64,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This is the first time something like this has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:52.11,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.11,0:12:55.64,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,I'll make a new brand that suits you on the double.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.61,0:12:59.14,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,In the meantime, how about...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.20,0:13:07.31,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please deal with these clothes for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.24,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,I'm Laala.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.24,0:13:12.46,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Eh?! {goat sounds}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.20,0:13:17.47,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Since her brand registration has not been completed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:19.25,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,she can't enter any shows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:21.59,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Really? Isn't there anything you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.59,0:13:23.04,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,That's how the system works.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.67,0:13:33.10,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Man, I wanted to do a show in cute coords with Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:34.93,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.28,0:13:36.99,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.99,0:13:37.93,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:41.33,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This is PriPara!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.31,0:13:45.87,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's just like he described!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.87,0:13:48.15,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,PriPara is a wonderful place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:50.89,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,I'm glad you think it's so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.89,0:13:51.79,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.79,0:13:55.16,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,There are more places I'd like to show you over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.39,0:13:57.75,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Come on! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.12,0:14:02.56,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.56,0:14:05.07,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,There's so much greenery and flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:08.09,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,The air smells just like it does in Palps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:09.94,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.94,0:14:14.97,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Here I was drinking vegetable juice in a place like this,\N and then you had to go and do that-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:17.44,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,My precious vegetable juice...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.44,0:14:20.31,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,I spilled 350ml of it-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.31,0:14:21.90,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:23.84,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Don't think you can just get of with an "I'm sorry"!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.84,0:14:27.00,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Hand over enough to fill a bathtub to show you're sorry-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.00,0:14:28.44,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,You rooster...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:29.28,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.74,0:14:33.82,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Ku...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:35.07,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:37.08,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,What a refreshing smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.08,0:14:41.50,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,More like I've been healed by\N a soft breeze across the plains-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.50,0:14:45.50,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that a cute girl such as yourself is here in PriPara-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.44,0:14:49.11,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,It seems Kuma has also taken a liking to you, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:49.81,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.81,0:14:51.82,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Is this a friend of yours, Laala?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.82,0:14:53.85,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Who is this girl-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:54.72,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,What's her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.72,0:14:55.67,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,What year?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.67,0:14:57.16,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Blood type?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.16,0:14:59.44,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,What's her type? Could it be a bear like me...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.44,0:15:02.30,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Type? A bear might be too much...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.30,0:15:03.89,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Wah! Fuwari?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.89,0:15:05.19,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,System,0,0,0,,{(ﾁｬｲﾑ)}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.58,0:15:09.40,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Attention idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.40,0:15:14.91,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,we'll be switching the hologrammation to artificial rain to water the flowers and greenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.91,0:15:16.49,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This was the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.57,0:15:18.20,PriPara,Rand1,0,0,0,,Wa{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.20,0:15:19.24,PriPara,Rand2,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.24,0:15:20.45,PriPara,Rand2,0,0,0,,I'm getting all wet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.83,0:15:23.16,PriPara,Rand3,0,0,0,,Let's wait in the café until it stops.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:24.37,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:27.03,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What are you doing out there-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.03,0:15:29.59,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,I got separated from Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:30.34,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.34,0:15:31.84,PriPara,Mirela,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{♪♪｢ﾗ～ ﾗﾗﾗﾗﾗﾗ ﾗﾗﾗ｣}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{,♪♪｢ﾗ～ ﾗﾗﾗﾗﾗﾗﾗ～｣}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.27,0:15:48.61,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What beautiful flowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.06,0:15:51.11,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,And the rain feels great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{♪♪｢ﾌﾜﾗﾗ ﾗﾗ ﾌﾜﾗ～｣}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.19,0:15:58.99,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Fuwari...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.51,0:16:07.87,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,Wait, my servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{♪♪｢ﾗﾗ ﾔｷﾞさん ﾌﾜﾗ～｣}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{♪♪｢ﾗﾗﾗ ﾌ ﾗﾗﾗ～｣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{♪♪｢ﾗ ﾌﾜﾗﾗ～｣}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{♪♪｢ﾌﾜﾗﾗ ﾗﾗ ﾌﾜﾗ～｣}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{♪♪｢ﾗﾗ ﾌﾜ ﾗﾋﾗ～｣}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.95,0:16:32.53,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Wowzers! She's got such a big audience!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:36.12,PriPara,Aloma,0,0,0,,One must fear those who \Nhold the power to manipulate animals!{Ye must fear the one who holds the power to manipulate animals!}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:37.70,PriPara,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan wants to be her friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.52,0:16:40.66,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is the power of the princess candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.04,0:16:44.82,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}She has a charm that's different than any other girl-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.82,0:16:46.92,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}If we form a five person team with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:50.88,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure we'll be able to sweep the\NSummer Dream Idol Grand Prix-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:53.09,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{♪♪｢ﾌｧｰ ﾔﾎ ﾐﾗﾎ～｣}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:00.95,PriPara,Rand,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.95,0:17:02.51,PriPara,Rand2,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:05.02,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,That was incredible, Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.02,0:17:07.97,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Your voice is clearer than a jellyfish.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.97,0:17:09.73,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Even your impromptu show is great-pri.{Not sure how exactly to handle that "grass show". My first instinct was "guerilla show" but that sounds a little dramatic. It's just referring to the fact she's doing it in a field so maybe "lawn show"? - krym}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.73,0:17:11.90,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.90,0:17:12.94,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.25,0:17:14.74,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What do you mean "show"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.74,0:17:16.03,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,{No way!}{as they crash}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:19.53,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,That's right. You've always lived in the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.53,0:17:21.79,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,You've never seen a show before.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.79,0:17:23.28,PriPara,Sophie,0,0,0,,Would you show her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.28,0:17:25.24,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Eh? Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.24,0:17:27.50,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Even if you say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.50,0:17:30.71,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'd love to see Laala's show.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.71,0:17:34.24,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Just get out there and show her-pri.{I think this capture the essence of the whole sentence by itself. - krym}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.24,0:17:35.67,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:36.78,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:41.89,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.53,0:17:45.47,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.03,0:17:51.67,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,An image of a sparkling hydrangea wet with rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:54.10,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The sheer frills are quite elegant!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.10,0:17:55.61,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Hydrangea Bouquet Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:13.89,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.16,0:19:15.78,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Princess...{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.78,0:19:17.15,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Princess, where are you-kuma?!!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.65,0:19:20.68,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma?{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:23.03,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Flower garden in full bloom!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:24.15,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,For you!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.41,0:19:28.50,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Lovely Flower Cinderella!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.50,0:19:30.16,PriPara,Kuma,0,0,0,,Kuma!{ep43}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.19,0:19:34.07,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:22.60,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was wonderful, Laala.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.60,0:20:24.07,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.81,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.81,0:20:28.34,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to début as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:30.89,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\i1}And become the ideal princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.99,0:20:35.85,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Laala, that was really, really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.85,0:20:37.67,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.67,0:20:38.84,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,All right, let's snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.84,0:20:39.31,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.08,0:20:46.32,PriPara,Mirelle,0,0,0,,How the heck did you snap cheese?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.32,0:20:48.45,PriPara,Sohpie,0,0,0,,It's authentic Palps cheese.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:51.41,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,This is how you exchange Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.10,0:20:53.87,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Let's do a show together someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:20:55.19,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.29,0:20:59.04,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,At this time the rain will stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.41,0:21:01.06,PriPara,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,This was the system.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:10.63,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, my prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.63,0:21:15.56,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to to become a princess worthy of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.27,0:21:24.48,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Ms. Gloria,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.13,0:21:28.37,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'll be arriving shortly as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:07.29,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.29,0:23:10.42,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to become a beautiful princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.42,0:23:12.84,PriPara,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I look forward to it, my princess.{待遠しいよ}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.84,0:23:16.01,PriPara,Laala,0,0,0,,Why has Fuwari's prince come to Paprika Academy?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.01,0:23:18.97,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I want to sing at PriPara soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.97,0:23:21.72,PriPara,Shion,0,0,0,,We'll help you search for a manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:25.77,PriPara,Dorthy,0,0,0,,We'll make Fuwari our friend and be the next ones to do the Grand Prix. {The Grand Prix is the 5-man thing right? I'm getting confused now because of the season coord crap - krym}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.77,0:23:27.52,PriPara,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorothy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:28.92,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:31.93,PriPara,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince and the Blue Bird of Sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.93,0:23:33.27,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:34.78,PriPara,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
